### Space & Facility requests (phase 5). Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and the IntelliJ HTTP client.
### Needs the ADMIN role. Run them in order; the state changes carry over (spaces, taps, records).
@host = https://tarjepafi-api-pafi7k2.azurewebsites.net
# @host = http://localhost:8080
@adminEmail = admin@upc.edu.pe
@adminPassword = Admin123*

### 0. Sign in as administrator (the deployed demo uses another password: ask the backend owner)
# @name signIn
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

###
@token = {{signIn.response.body.$.token}}

### 1. Register a space (TS18): 201 AVAILABLE; again: 409 SPACE_CODE_EXISTS; capacity 0: 400 INVALID_CAPACITY
POST {{host}}/api/v1/spaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "EVT-01", "name": "Auditorio", "type": "EVENT_VENUE", "building": "Pabellón A", "floor": 1,
  "capacity": 300, "accessPolicy": "OPEN", "allowedRoles": ["STUDENT", "TEACHER"] }

### 2. Maintenance: taps at RDR-D-001 are denied with SPACE_IN_MAINTENANCE until it is AVAILABLE again
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/spaces/sp-lab-c/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "MAINTENANCE" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/iot/readers/RDR-D-001/taps
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardUid": "04:3D:9B:12:8F" }

###
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/spaces/sp-lab-c/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "AVAILABLE" }

### 3. Change the policy of the library (TS28): only staff; 400 INVALID_ROLE for an unknown role
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/spaces/sp-bib/access-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accessPolicy": "RESTRICTED", "allowedRoles": ["STAFF"] }

###
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/spaces/sp-bib/access-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accessPolicy": "OPEN", "allowedRoles": ["STUDENT", "TEACHER", "STAFF"] }

### 4. Occupancy (TS19): the campus entrance counts people inside today; other spaces answer tracked false
GET {{host}}/api/v1/spaces/sp-ent-01/occupancy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/spaces/sp-lab-c/occupancy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Access records, newest first, polling with `after` (filters spaceId, cardHolderId, decision)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/access-records?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/access-records?decision=DENIED&spaceId=sp-lab-e
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Work shifts of the staff (filters cardHolderId, status OPEN/CLOSED, date)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/work-shifts?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Stays on campus of a holder (TS30): from and to are campus date-times; 400 INVALID_RANGE when from is after to
GET {{host}}/api/v1/card-holders/ch-u202312966/campus-presences?from=2026-10-05T00:00:00&to=2026-10-07T23:59:59
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
